notes = "(!) x86-64 only, on a CPU with AVX2: the game's code runs directly on the host CPU.|(!) Needs a GPU with Vulkan 1.3. The frontend's video driver does not matter: the core hands over finished frames.|(!) Load a dumped game's eboot.bin.|(!) Everything the core keeps is in system/shadPS4/, laid out as standalone shadPS4's user folder: settings, save data, shader cache, dumped system modules and fonts, and its log, log/shadps4.log.|(!) The emulator runs in a process of its own, started by the core."
description = "A port of shadPS4, a PlayStation 4 emulator, to libretro. It needs an x86-64 CPU with AVX2 and a GPU with Vulkan 1.3, and no BIOS; some games need system modules and fonts dumped from a console. An early core: games may not start."
